        "text": "Hi, welcome to Binance Academy's Web3 and Metaverse course. In this course you will learn the basics of web3, the metaverse, non fungible tokens, and gamefi blockchain. Technology is a critical component of the future megatrends of our digital world. In this first module, we explain the concept of Web3, a term you've probably already heard much about. To know what Web3 is, we need to first understand Web 1.0 and Web 2.0. Web 1.0 refers to the first version of the Web. During the early 1990s, a few people created static and primarily text based web pages for a large group of readers to read. This publisher, Centric Web 1.0 can be called the Read Only Web, designed to help people find information with little interactivity. There was almost no way for users to interact with the information or upload their own data except through simple text based chat messages and online forums.",
